  loves:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 991a6891d6fa5cf45a18629d3d7b1df4, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5148bc82bfb79f94ca5482ed8e4ea69f, type: 2}
  jobs:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: f918ba89b7b235448905310320940c70, type: 2}
  questLine:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2e1f14cdaba5e04489fb71d9fe5ccb3, type: 2}
    text: I kept watch for the expedition until there was nothing left to watch. Let me do it here. A post with a view of the old path, and the ward holds longer when it breaks.
    acceptText: I'll build you a post.
    waitingText: A Watch Post where I can see the old path. It wants Tor's lodge standing first.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a362bac9b0bcd234f9541c6db47d3732, type: 2}
    text: When the ward breaks they come through the gaps. Spikes in the gaps, three at least, and we hold the next one together.
    acceptText: Spikes in the gaps.
    waitingText: Three spike traps where they'll come through. Then hold the next breach.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c414ab0a8aa5e4841ae686c8aa21b4f2, type: 2}
    text: The Brukam's dead and its tusk is lying out there. Hollow it, bind it in iron, hang it on the post. When the ward breaks I'll blow it, and every one of us will shoot like we mean it.
    acceptText: I'll bring you the tusk.
    waitingText: The Brukam's tusk, and the Watch Post at Tier III to hang it on. Then we hold the next breach.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1899eaf9b830925479e5fa309b359320, type: 2}
    text: My sister Sigrun sewed a red thread into my coat before I left. Said I was too stupid to find my way home without it. That valley's full of old camps. If one of them has her thread in it, I want it.
    acceptText: I'll look for her thread.
    waitingText: A camp half under the snow in Troll Valley. A red thread. Bring it to the portal.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  questLineDone: 
